[{"sha": "2f6f92e881c17df15e542b7d3498f1bb91dc9af0", "node_id": "C_kwDOFDO16doAKDJmNmY5MmU4ODFjMTdkZjE1ZTU0MmI3ZDM0OThmMWJiOTFkYzlhZjA", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Chris Keller", "email": "ckeller@redhat.com", "date": "2022-03-17T20:21:01Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2022-03-17T20:21:01Z"}, "message": "Implement Pool of Image Builder Hosts (#243)\n\n* Adding support for N number of Image Builder VMs to support pooling.\r\n\r\n* Updating volume names.\r\n\r\n* Making volume names consistent.\r\n\r\n* Templatizing root disk.\r\n\r\n* Adding missing variable.\r\n\r\n* Removing chomps.\r\n\r\n* Using variable in wrong context.\r\n\r\n* Updating QuayRegistry CR to include managed TLS component.\r\n\r\n* Reorganizing components in QuayRegistry CR.\r\n\r\n* Ignore whatever Quay Operator is doing wrong this time.\r\n\r\n* Updating VM/VMI labels to support n number of image builder VMs.\r\n\r\n* Updating role to support multiple instances of image builder.\r\n\r\n* rfe-image-builders -> builders. Adding support for multiple image builders to playbook.\r\n\r\n* Dropping sources task. Updating Image Builder chart to generate k8s service per VM.\r\n\r\n* Fixing variable scope.\r\n\r\n* Adding debug...\r\n\r\n* Adjusting variable scope.\r\n\r\n* instance_expected_count->image_builder_replicas. Updating Job to include extra var for image_builder_replicas.\r\n\r\n* Moving from k8s_info wait_condition to explicit check.\r\n\r\n* Initial scheduler role.\r\n\r\n* Adding pipeline_target_host to inventory.\r\n\r\n* Updating create image playbook to support scheduler.\r\n\r\n* Updating image pipeline to use scheduler.\r\n\r\n* Updating image-builder-host param for image pipeline.\r\n\r\n* Updating installer image pipeline to use scheduler.\r\n\r\n* Updating ISO build playbook to use scheduled host.\r\n\r\n* Updating oci-build-auto-iso role to source ISO from proper pool member.\r\n\r\n* pipeline_target_host->image_builder_host. Adding run_once to some tasks in scheduler role.\r\n\r\n* +image-builder-content-sources role. Integrating with create-image pipeline.\r\n\r\n* Reworking image-builder-content-sources role.\r\n\r\n* Updating oci-image-pipeline to pass additional parameters to build-image task.\r\n\r\n* Adjusting JSON parsing.\r\n\r\n* Fixing empty additional_content_sources value.\r\n\r\n* Revert JSON parse change.\r\n\r\n* Adding missing Jinja template.\r\n\r\n* Adding missing loop to task.\r\n\r\n* Adding image-builder-content-sources role to build auto ISO playbook.\r\n\r\n* Updating ISO pipeline to leverage content sources.\r\n\r\n* Removing content sources from auto ISO task. Outputting pipeline target host for debug.\r\n\r\n* Adding missing tasks field.\r\n\r\n* Limiting debug task to run_once/localhost.\r\n\r\n* Fixing merge conflicts.\r\n\r\n* Dropping composer sources tasks from image-builder role.\r\n\r\n* Dropping remaining legacy composer sources components.\r\n\r\n* Adding additional documentation.", "tree": {"sha": "afe8ed0afd7ec8f9061320462723994822128685", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-cop/rhel-edge-automation-arch/git/trees/afe8ed0afd7ec8f9061320462723994822128685"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-cop/rhel-edge-automation-arch/git/commits/2f6f92e881c17df15e542b7d3498f1bb91dc9af0", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJiM5gtCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAA/OMIAHuxnR0QP+rMPdWv+v221Bi2\nqw9qiEkJkI8kaWPjKnTtqcwX1CGcg6iMBZJF+oK3fj1Aii2zLEbzYRAQPyO+JaTy\nCvCIISCUBiBJcbBwKzPbGDH/42HiqOumNHgZfuV5VHqmiDvRkcNaJ+3mFNYl8jaC\nGhnsvJk1NVba3RpHsa5U59cl45K9KYPwmpwK8yuDwoXkYBsEbRz3PDCzWxfPErOj\nbVMUqlaSidwWZUKeDX9t1Lf9M4MNcV6PkVXy2Z+KgHBIuwfhxDqdkIftjXmtPmQG\nlZyCyJ/zQevBp8nz2ipBmzLtBac3zmIzEQRR6Er5DeNDEnIFA2obtPkmVCYK8Bo=\n=vtlV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree afe8ed0afd7ec8f9061320462723994822128685\nparent 4d19938adf1f667ace552053b87bcfef217c2bf2\nauthor Chris Ke