uild-image task.\r\n\r\n* Adjusting JSON parsing.\r\n\r\n* Fixing empty additional_content_sources value.\r\n\r\n* Revert JSON parse change.\r\n\r\n* Adding missing Jinja template.\r\n\r\n* Adding missing loop to task.\r\n\r\n* Adding image-builder-content-sources role to build auto ISO playbook.\r\n\r\n* Updating ISO pipeline to leverage content sources.\r\n\r\n* Removing content sources from auto ISO task. Outputting pipeline target host for debug.\r\n\r\n* Adding missing tasks field.\r\n\r\n* Limiting debug task to run_once/localhost.\r\n\r\n* Fixing merge conflicts.\r\n\r\n* Dropping composer sources tasks from image-builder role.\r\n\r\n* Dropping remaining legacy composer sources components.\r\n\r\n* Adding additional documentation.", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-cop/rhel-edge-automation-arch/commits/2f6f92e881c17df15e542b7d3498f1bb91dc9af0", "html_url": "https://github.com/redhat-cop/rhel-edge-automation-arch/commit/2f6f92e881c17df15e542b7d3498f1bb91dc9af0", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-cop/rhel-edge-automation-arch/commits/2f6f92e881c17df15e542b7d3498f1bb91dc9af0/comments", "author": {"login": "nasx", "id": 12864540, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEyODY0NTQw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12864540?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/nasx", "html_url": "https://github.com/nasx", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nasx/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nasx/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nasx/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nasx/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nasx/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nasx/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nasx/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nasx/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https